message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the following."
title: "sphalerite-lattice-mc: a statistical thermodynamic lattice model for Cu-In coupled substitution in sphalerite"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a four-term configurational Hamiltonian for the
  sphalerite cation sublattice, comprising a local charge-compensation penalty
  with a parameter-free coefficient, an elastic misfit term, a substitution
  energy and a vacancy term, sampled by Metropolis Monte Carlo with Kawasaki
  exchange dynamics. Includes the verification suite reproducing all analytic
  limits.
